@startuml quote-flow
!include _theme.iuml
skinparam linetype polyline
title Quote
caption GET /api/v1/quote. Local math over Redis; Classic via Horizon. Numbers match the Architecture page.

actor Client
participant "api-server" as API
participant "PathFinder" as PF
database Redis
participant "QuoteEngine" as QE
participant "SplitOptimizer" as SO
participant Horizon as Horizon

Client -> API : 1. GET /api/v1/quote
API -> PF : 2. find_candidate_paths(graph)
PF --> API : candidate paths\n(no liquidity prune)
API -> Redis : 3. MGET pool keys\nxyk · aquarius · clmm · comet
Redis --> API : cached pool state
API -> QE : 4. quote each path at amount_in
QE -> Horizon : 4. Classic PathPayment
Horizon --> QE : classic output
QE --> API : QuotedPath list
API -> SO : 5. split Soroban paths if\nimpact or competitive delta warrants it
SO --> API : Soroban OptimalRoute
API -> API : 6. Classic if classic.out > soroban.out\nelse Soroban
API --> Client : 7. expected_output · min_out · sub_routes

@enduml
